# ---- the two suites that read documents rather than the screen -----------------------------
# They live in this directory and run with the rest, but nothing they check is in `ui/`, so
# their rows name what they actually read. Both would otherwise be suites with no inputs,
# which the reconciliation refuses — correctly: "reads nothing" is never true of a suite.
docs-claims.js          richos/app/crates/ richos/app/src-tauri/src/ richos/app/ui/tests/ richos/app/scripts/proof-for.ui-inputs richos/app/README.md richos/app/STREAMING.md richos/app/ui/tests/README.md richos/app/crates/richos-core/src/stream.rs richos/app/crates/richos-core/src/live.rs richos/app/crates/richos-core/src/machinery.rs richos/app/crates/richos-core/src/upstream.rs richos/app/crates/richos-voice/src/event.rs
